<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber cuts UST.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber cuts UST.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber said it downgraded UST Inc to neutral from attractive.</p>
<p>-- Cut 1997 earnings estimate to $2.57 a share from $2.67.</p>
<p>-- &quot;UST is caught between a rock and a hard place, what with private label products significantly undercutting the price that UST charges for its Skoal and Copenhagen brands,&quot; a PaineWebber report said.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended up 1/4 at 31-1/2.</p>
</text>
